  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8d453f1cea6951dec554e53",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请以冠军的身份说几句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b647c07252222aaaf6d0bbcc87b7e54238be45d93026be0816e00175b21f1f47",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "723"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed3af225108b73cba481888f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "撑过了严苛考验后，现在的心情如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd7d37a4b58cd62614d6a2cb1260f23b02bfd18cbeb28f58d8232ee6d9a2305f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "724"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c029997a7403429577bdd502",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天的竞赛中有让你觉得感动的事物吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d3f0822f4312c53a45d12c86bae9b3c05192fc243495a4d65b76989f519152",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "725"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a927eb8672c3034008829b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请向为你声援至今的粉丝说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "731f2464c60761dbf5d5e339cae580ec178baf10b93def2a7da1157dfd19748a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "726"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8a3009064e379c7fb9cc336",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "恭喜你获得优胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbef6f8cacab123c75f31d503257e9beb4c93e16aed31e6d018febdd38c735b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "727"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95e60a686c17c9ecae371a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "简单来说，今天的获胜原因是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7853a48a3f3ab5a12edd0cbab6734dfd035d313e7814008521f8dd7c013e13c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "728"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4df5c82e0037e2a4a6adb3dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "恭喜你获得优胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbef6f8cacab123c75f31d503257e9beb4c93e16aed31e6d018febdd38c735b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "729"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1178578de37663e7dbaa6184",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会吃喜欢的蛋糕来庆祝胜利吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a3a023b2e367983a21cd9b69eea7daf403bcbf61dc341248bfe229dc039906e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "73"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4abcc440999e5c9d0115d679",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我记住「圣王口号」了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91e9bbb86f258ca8f09e16fc4e89c8f5d2344c37b03eb2b8980d22f669a37a7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "730"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76baeb6a59d2d22560b5167e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你昨天晚上其实长了荨麻疹……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c28a5f519a3cdf0854b13e1ba08ae5447303ccd17842d1273b4f5b64e57402",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "731"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:843841c70695be881bdc3232",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "恭喜你获得优胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbef6f8cacab123c75f31d503257e9beb4c93e16aed31e6d018febdd38c735b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "732"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d4ec4e0dfddc0c0eb17814b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "勝利を掴み取った今の感想を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7493d9c47ed2957fc22ec6bd437742521fdf27fb4fac77b0dab95462768977f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "733"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd0e59c320d5cf08217f4b38",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "この勝利を誰に捧げますか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7a43c8e1e2aea437fcfd92f870c67112f039a4988fbdc477480dcad20795ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "734"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a3cd185e8f75d066bda5bbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼喊「善信」的声音不绝于耳呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af217ae52ddf198aa7cd5faace0dc44d655981b4b6c310e59f15dbf5f202b6a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "735"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838cc72002537bdb9c0c2276",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对和你一同迈进的训练员说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "097ac93f8d36bb3ef9affe43c6d74379e30563e8729c2db3308f087ceacf6c16",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "736"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cea31152b3c814c23cd87c49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "震撼人心的胜利！是场相当激烈的竞赛呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ee265aacc9eb5e0abf022c3ac2e41ec8a3248a52772ae14da6dcdecec26f4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "737"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d93a3936fd28a5f4b0a2dd90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场胜利，想先跟谁分享呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a50c631c76a52916c264ba5f53506626c017d08d120cdf001ec2728ec6803c23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "738"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:589cee8bf2ca9a103e860de1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "压倒性的实力！吸引了所有目光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a75c9b7193b24669e09f4b08399b14df4b36b6a7b373e2671555f9e082c54cca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "739"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce20a4c92cdce197bca0a1ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "整场竞赛的发展都如你预期吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccdb491faa3b80b337458a97bdf842284061cb0772d03976e8a60d706257f85a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "74"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6555bf771fd7b6b3dbd0e872",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有什么话想对训练员说的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e391fbe5ac66b1722047d502038d7fd17fa14313b440a85f004c2edfa459f302",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "740"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:443193ceb1718b94208f2a22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请用一句话形容你现在的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ffacd22e787253ba356db7539871b3eb092e39ead610df0b7ef8c53d6465b9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62bbd2f41e24643d33106c6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "恭喜你获得优胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbef6f8cacab123c75f31d503257e9beb4c93e16aed31e6d018febdd38c735b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "742"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad84608acacb975cbe9de08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你最先将获胜的喜悦传达给了谁？",
      "source_fingerprint": "93f0097b753409b46bc6aa3120be27ebae9f881dd2b869d6c9c2dea872643d46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "743"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad21e5f1cee634190441383a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天的转音也是相当地动听喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d469192594c87efd4a6ed3e116bf0f0f45b5cc800886f44c4eb5353d55b7698",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "744"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d193e50659ce5b22b8a956d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对和你一起走到了这里的训练员说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93d672f5b64adad539ca1c584802d994f88cbb64e1819c1aebff9409b0ec89ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "745"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c5195d8d8d68f41d5226b02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以请你发表格言吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1faa24783a1d71c17191c2e628bb4566a4e363af085be661793e4fd216923186",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "746"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35479e4eab9f809b74a2256e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请针对竞赛发表感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb76c82153db35de63f5ca6025641ee3a49f5a21ddca6dfefa538ef26ab36fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "747"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb3c0c17aa25ef3204291d74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对签约训练员说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52035a20f686c9314746b0b32ef70b537e6da674c79f6b1de14553096641d072",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "748"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06663dce4fe74ed2981e803e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请以一句话来形容你现在的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e53ee4cf0bd86e8e5641508cfb25d9218a5b688ac576dcff425a626473ed631d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "749"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21209d7b6d1da522132473a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你今早上传的水果三明治照片是……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b14946c6d1f1fcd992782b95b2f2a60120f821b6a4c588a4b2a3847bb754f390",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:062cc37972211428b7e597db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对带领你拿下优胜的签约训练员说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c3293279c66e263be21447faa2c6be244d20b8a031d2eae31b62f6973132f31",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "750"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf5b83de5bb2753bdef09a6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对八重无敌小姐来说，何谓「强悍」？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f20de1d379021b4ac7551651762883444dec11d199362e492125c96fa918a3d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "751"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b64d6b5c11012b2cfc40465",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如同自己的名字般所向无敌后的感想是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5257676063fe8a366ed4a2b5522748c914b0428ef10b2bbdadf95626f7b55850",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "752"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0184f28fece4022f1015df66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想对目白家族的成员说些什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4294b7dfbdd2a91f682dce15ca691ca78a52327f4bbcc0a0fe25778bbb3e9f20",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "755"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2295406b8ff668e3b7a0d0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你现在的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ffcd377e6a6ac7132795adaf740ff989cc0e8321a870fd489f4f9efd43ec2ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "756"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f427a5f0ae1314c90202e79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请给予与自己有相同境遇的人们鼓励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32a4b6068f0255cf7bf3141fe38cb6e0d66f93711c8a913ad30702264e7d8ec0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "759"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:066a971b682205e882434367",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5af0f64085ff6426a046679705388129f151c4ca7bad839a95ba1f0a10f1be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "76"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cca75d8100f3141680d22c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你称霸了比赛！请问现在的心情如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "277776351938f9f1f9e373ee3e6c467a4b801a3e9637683e318484cd3ee218b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "760"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7610a77b6156761a699fa33d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该能以今天的胜利成为日本第一了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b4401960b8597e5a9fb9d322333886ae8c7f1c55f13027acebfccecce6b1329",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "761"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ece5575116a5c024583ece81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最想将这份喜悦传达给谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92f5571e3c36bdeebcd6ee8011c9dce86cd3c8d744153b96840fe604d2947a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "762"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a58a3291f5e499ea803f4a7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "该不会等一下立刻就要去跑步吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "221cd37ed80fb3fb1860e4df3f6d28b96c5ca7c665853c0aa8764b1b9f270926",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "763"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b99dd6150ebe11ad7a249a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "都做了些什么来祈求好运？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f9b6063c6bce629c5beb3cf96218cb2cd272fd0ba5cf44379f1c11dd9205e8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "764"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f7af65fabc9090221d5cfd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "果然是要用「蜂蜜特饮」来庆祝胜利吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a50f29b7d90ee7a8718461d3a8901100d3009fdf908fa1ba81993c12e85030df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "765"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53fbeb96bab91c82500a92dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "接下来有什么计划呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b555c8151c91f0bc02a29515e8f35169e620810cd3a9a020499a77f73e50617",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "766"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1403a3f2c0877f7207a52ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请向前来加油的粉丝说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f1d38e72d3b33d29a74190755a9b287574306f0fd7a6878e60f5727d0f6df4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "767"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:178163adbf7a6b403ebc73cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对于胜者舞台有什么建议吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87c7fda4dc4360f5e9b45d6a4394c270672f8a3b2b4122891e56f295ec1152da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "768"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c9327151c8e06468de50e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想必你为了今天，经历了很多辛劳吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e7569ddf20012d9d23dc6d385e74ce3c90d0b19b28c062dd0ea8f399a558388",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "769"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b4b608b022dd4c9a6143f29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "刚才摆给粉丝看的那个姿势是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a41de7468ebc04d4771c3a030c9cf5cc98956c31f1fad4faf89004738102c43",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "77"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:381203798bd21cd06a1a3f42",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "相当精彩的表现，让我深受感动……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "743226d1dfee9cfcf9b2043e904f5be7c25f33342a1cefad6ddab6da56ac56db",
